        "Title": "Too close to the sun",
        "Location": "LOCATION_HOKKAIDO",
        "PublicId": "110944716338",
        "ScenePath": "assembly:/_PRO/Scenes/Missions/Hokkaido/_scene_snowcrane.entity",
        "TileImage": "$($repository 1830b453-7d68-4290-a056-97174fb6c8f2).Image",
        "Description": "Good evening,\r\rOur client has some unfinished business with your targets, which he&apos;d rather not elaborate. But since he is a big fan of the myths and legends of Ancient Greece, he would like to see these two face the same fate as one of the most mythical characters: Icarus. The boy who flew too close to the sun, fell down into the sea and drowned. \r\rI don&apos;t think that will be a problem for you.\r\rGood luck.",
